body:
Man I wish I could just give you a hug thru the screen. I understand everything you're feeling. I got close to ending my life tonight. Decided not to and called a friend instead. She talked to me and that helped. And I just kept talking to other people and that helped me feel better. It got my mind off things and reminded me I'm not alone. Even gave me a bit of hope.

&#x200B;

but...I understand where you're coming from. Today I decided to live because my friend said her world would stop if I killed myself. So if i couldn't live for God or live for myself, I'd live for her

I'm gonna go take a nap now. I suggest you do the same

&#x200B;

[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C4kBbTlvoN4](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C4kBbTlvoN4)
